  "details": "Almost all of the animation events listed in the \"whitelisted\" category are not actually possible to use.\nhttps://docs.vrchat.com/docs/animation-events\nFor example, try adding an Animator to something, then create a Clip on that animator and an event in that animator. Note that the event will have no possible selections.\nAs far as is known, the only two events that can actually be called via an animation event are SendCustomEvent and RunProgram.",
